      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This is the approach used in real-world frontend projects."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "What it is:CSS written in a separate .css file and linked to HTML."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Where it connects:Using a <link> tag inside the <head>."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<head>\n2  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n3</head>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1p {\n2  color: #333;\n3}"
    },
